The Midnight Meat Train is a horror, mystery,
fantasy film directed by Ryuhei Kitamura.

3
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:26,000
A photographer's obsessive pursuit of dark subject matter leads him into the path of a serial killer
who stalks late night commuters, ultimately butchering them in the most gruesome ways.

