10
00:54:26,666 --> 00:54:32,666
The Midnight Meat Train is a 2008 American horror film based on
Clive Barker's 1984 short story of the same name.

11
00:59:53,333 --> 00:59:59,333
Its plot follows a photographer who attempts to track down a serial killer dubbed the "Subway
Butcher", and discovers more than he bargained for under the city streets.

12
01:05:20,000 --> 01:05:26,000
Directed by Ryuhei Kitamura, the film stars Bradley Cooper, Leslie Bibb,
Brooke Shields, Roger Bart, Ted Raimi and Vinnie Jones.

13
01:10:46,666 --> 01:10:52,666
Its script was adapted by Jeff Buhler, the producer was Tom Rosenberg of
Lakeshore Entertainment, and it was released on August 1, 2008.

14
01:16:13,333 --> 01:16:19,333
The film received mixed reviews.

15
01:21:40,000 --> 01:21:46,000
Producer Joe Daley, a long-time friend of Buhler's, brought the two writers together and helped develop the script, along with producers Anthony DiBlasi and Jorge Saralegui, for their and Clive
Barker's production company Midnight Picture Show, which was responsible for Book of Blood, the next film adaptation from the anthology of short stories that spawned The Midnight Meat Train.

16
01:27:06,666 --> 01:27:12,666
The film explores themes of photographer, gore, butcher, vegetarian, stalking.

17
01:32:33,333 --> 01:32:39,333
The tone is dark and mind_bending.
